    "m_FunctionSource": "",
    "m_FunctionBody": "float3 blend = abs(_normalW);\r\nblend /= dot(blend, float3(1,1,1));\r\n\r\nfloat3 heights = float3(_height.x, _height.y, _height.z) + (blend * 3.0);\r\nfloat height_start = max(max(heights.x, heights.y), heights.z) - _HeightmapBlending;\r\nfloat3 h = max(heights - float3(height_start,height_start,height_start), float3(0,0,0));\r\nblend = h / dot(h, float3(1,1,1));\n\r\n_out = blend;"
